      "text": "Motorboat ride during the evening:\n\nDuration: 1 hour. Time is approximate.\n\nVisit to a Caboclo House \n\nDuration: 1 hour. Time is approximate.\n\nFishing\n\nDuration: 40 minutes to 1 hour. Time is approximate.\n\nPlease note that this activity is for non-professional fishermen.",
